 The [2026-10-21 coupled task proof / JSON / Web readout](evals/2026-10-21-task-proof-json-web/README.md) records two adaptive three-model rounds, their unchanged oracles and remaining failure modes.
+
+To inspect the stock replay cases before choosing which one to run:
+
+```sh
+spiral tui-replay-list --filter prefs --max-cases 1
+```
+
+This read-only command prints JSON with the selected count, case IDs and tags.
+It accepts the same spec path relative to `--tool-root` (`-C`) as `tui-replay`.
+A case matches when its ID or any tag contains the filter, ignoring ASCII case.
+The cap is applied in spec order after filtering; zero selects at most one.
+Listing never executes the cases or writes replay artifacts. Use `tui-replay` to run them.
